<title>TURKEY: TURKEY SETS 399-D BOND AUCTION FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>TURKEY SETS 399-D BOND AUCTION FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday a 13-month (399-day) bond auction after 13-month auction on January 7.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : February 25, 1998</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>    Auction date: January 21, 1997</p>
<p>    Value date  : January 22, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 ATA</p>
